B.wc=new A.o4("Package name not found","The test checks your Digital Asset Links JSON file for package name validation, which the mobile device uses to verify ownership of the app.",'Ensure your Digital Asset Links JSON file declares the correct package name with the "android_app" namespace for all of the failed website domains. Also, confirm that the app is available in the Google Play store. See the following recommended asset link json file. ')
